Negative control for the default-row marker in CARD view (C12/D14).

Drops the star from the card's lead, so the default row reads as the default in
the table's marker column and as an ordinary row in cards — the same rows
telling two different stories depending on which view is on.

Apply from the repo root: `git apply <this file>`; revert with `git apply -R`.

Reds: the card-view marker spec — the declared marker is present in BOTH views.

